      <p>

      You can easily convert between the two using Python's built-in
      <code>list()</code> and <code>tuple()</code> constructors.

      This is useful if you receive a tuple but need to modify it, or if you
      build a list and want to lock it down.

      </p>


      <p>Example:</p>


